        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uze witondere umusi w’isabato, kugira ng’ uwuziririze, nk’ uko jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe nabikugeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misi itandatu az’ abe ari yo ukoreramw’ ibikorwa vyawe vyose: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arik’ umusi ugira indwi ni wo sabato yanje, jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe. Ntukagire igikorwa na kimwe ukora kuri wo, wewe ubgawe, cank’ umuhungu wawe, cank’ umukobga wawe, cank’ umugurano wawe, cank’ umuguranokazi wawe, cank’ inka yawe, cank’ indogoba yawe, cank’ ibitungano vyawe ivy’ ari vyo vyose, cank’ uw’ inyambukīra aba i wawe; kugira ng’ umugurano wawe n’umuguranokazi wawe babone kuruhūka nkawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 20:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uze wibuke yuko nawe wari mu buja mu gihugu ca Egiputa, jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe nagukūjey’ ukuboko kw’inkomezi kandi kubanguye; ni co catumye jewe Uhoraho mbikugera kuziririza umusi w’isabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
