          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubahe so na nyoko, nk’ uko jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe nabikugeze, kugira ng’ urambire mu gihugu jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe nzoguha, uhamererwe neza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
