                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At’ Icompa bagahorana ben’ uwo mutima, ubatera kunyubaha no kwama bitondera ivyagezwe vyanje vyose, kugira ngo bamererwe neza, bo n’uruvyaro rwabo, ibihe vyose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati Genda ubabgire, uti Ni mwisubirire mu mahema yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At’ Ariko weho, ugume hano aho ndi, nkubarire ivyagezwe vyose n’amabgirizwa n’ibishinzwe ukwiye kubigisha, kugira ngo baze bavyitondere bashitse mu gihugu nabahaye kuzokwegukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
